kground-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">target</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">.</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">href</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">href </span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> href</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">.</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">replace</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,136,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">/\\/_w_[a-f0-9]+\\//</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">g</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,136,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&#39;/&#39;</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">);</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">  </span></div></blockquote><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\">because <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">ev</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">.</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">target </span>does not have key &quot;href&q